{"text": "MyChartwell | Signed in as dokereke88 | Messages (2) | Sign Out\n\nAfter Visit Summary\n\nPatient: Deshawn Okereke DOB: 07/14/1988 MRN: LF-00482719\n\nVisit: Monday, June 8, 2026 2:40 PM Visit # E-26-118402\n\nSeen by: Dr. Yusra Haidari, DO (NPI 1730482296) – Larchmont Family & Sports Medicine\n\n1480 Larchmont Court, Suite 200, Dublin, OH 43017 · 614-555-0152 · fax 614.555.0153\n\nReason for visit\n\nFollow-up of blood pressure and right knee pain after a soccer injury on May 23. You also asked about daytime sleepiness; your Epworth Sleepiness Scale score was 14.\n\nToday's vitals\n\nBP\tPulse\tTemp\tSpO2\tHeight\tWeight\tBMI\n\n148/94\t78\t98.2 °F\t97%\t5'11\"\t247 lb\t34.4\n\nProblem list\n\n- Essential hypertension (ICD-10 I10)\n\n- Prediabetes – A1c 6.1% on 5/29/2026\n\n- Suspected obstructive sleep apnea\n\n- Sprain of medial collateral ligament, right knee\n\nMedications\n\nInstructions\tQty / Refills\n\nStart amlodipine 5 mg once daily\t90 / 3\n\nContinue lisinopril 20 mg once daily\t90 / 1\n\nStop naproxen (raises blood pressure). Take acetaminophen for the knee.\t—\n\nAllergies: sulfa drugs (hives). Immunizations: Tdap given today in the left arm, lot U7184AA.\n\nPreferred pharmacy: Scioto Commons Pharmacy, 6620 Sawmill Rd, Columbus – Rx 4417092 sent electronically.\n\nInstructions\n\n- Lab: fasting lipid panel and TSH before your next visit.\n\n- Imaging: MRI right knee without contrast at Olentangy Imaging Partners, order IMG-2606-55817. They will call you at (614) 555-0177.\n\n- Referral: home sleep study. Bring the device back within 3 days.\n\n- PT twice a week for 6 weeks with Marisela Quintanar, PT.\n\n- If your home blood pressure is over 180/110, or you have chest pain, call 911.\n\nUpcoming appointments\n\nThu Jul 9, 2026 8:20 AM – Dr. Haidari, blood pressure recheck\n06/15/26 4:00 PM – Physical therapy evaluation, M. Quintanar\n\nPayment\n\nPlan: Buckeye Meridian Health Plan, member ID BMH884102773-01, group 0L4471. Billed as CPT 99214. Copay $40.00 paid today, Visa ending 0434 (cardholder Tamika Okereke). Receipt R-0608-2291. Balance from 4/2: $118.65.\n\nRecent sign-in activity\n\nWhen\tDevice / browser\tIP address\tLocation\n\n06/08/2026 6:12 PM\tChrome on Windows 11 – DESKTOP-OKRK7Q2\t198.51.100.34\tDublin, OH\n\n06/07/2026 9:48 PM\tSafari on iPhone – “Deshawn's iPhone”\t2001:db8:71a0:3::c4\tDublin, OH\n\n06/02/2026 11:05 AM\tEdge on Windows – HLP-FIN-LT-0417\t203.0.113.201\tHilliard, OH\n\n05/30/2026 7:31 AM\tFirefox on Android (proxy: Tamika)\t10.44.7.23\tUnrecognized\n\nWas this you? If not, change your password and call 1-800-555-0114. Proxy access for tokereke was granted 01/19/2026. Your record is available at https://mychartwell.larchmontfsm.example/avs/E-26-118402. Questions: frontdesk@larchmontfsm.example.\n\nPrinted for OKEREKE, DESHAWN A · This summary contains protected health information under HIPAA. © 2026 Chartwell Systems, Rev. 11", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "424 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Deshawn Okereke", "Yusra Haidari", "Marisela Quintanar", "Tamika Okereke", "Deshawn", "Tamika", "OKEREKE"], "companies": ["MyChartwell", "Larchmont Family & Sports Medicine", "Scioto Commons Pharmacy", "Buckeye Meridian Health Plan", "Olentangy Imaging Partners", "Mie Quintanar", "Chartwell Systems", "larchmontfsm", "OKEREKE"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Dublin", "Larchmont", "Larchmont Court", "614-555-0152", "614.555.0153", "Scioto Commons Pharmacy", "6620 Sawmill Rd", "Columbus", "Olentangy Imaging Partners", "Dublin, OH", "Hilliard, OH", "Unrecognized"], "health": ["essential hypertension", "prediabetes", "obstructive sleep apnea", "sprain of medial collateral ligament", "hypertension", "TPAP", "fasting lipid panel", "TSH", "lab", "MRI right knee without contrast", "chest pain", "proxy access", "protected health information"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Deshawn", "Yusra", "Marisela", "Tamika", "Tokereke"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.